## Conventions (short — full version in `CLAUDE.md`)

- Dates/times: patient-facing = Asia/Manila; API dates ISO 8601, DB timestamps UTC.
- Secrets: `apps/api/.env` (gitignored) — never commit or log tokens/PHI/PII.
- PHI safety: see `.cursor/rules/phi-data-safety.mdc` (always-on).
- Prod deploy/migration: blocked unless user says **`deskwave`** (`.cursor/rules/no-prod-deploy.mdc`).

## Docs sync

Behavior changes → update matching docs in the same change (`.cursor/rules/documentation-maintenance.mdc`). Per-route → `docs/guides/routes/` (`route-guides.mdc`). Phase progress → `docs/phases/README.md`.
